                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="Descriptions&#xa;&#xa;1. Light choux pastry shells&#xa;&#xa;2. Filled with whipped cream and fresh strawberries&#xa;&#xa;3. Crispy outside, creamy and fruity inside&#xa;&#xa;4. Elegant dessert for any occasion"/>
